  <!-- 2. A letter from Teta -->
  <section class="zab-letter" aria-label="A letter from Teta Huda">
    <div class="zab-wrap">
      <figure class="zab-polaroid"><img src="/landing/images/olive-harvest.jpg" alt="Grandma's hands picking olives"><span>Teta&rsquo;s hands, harvest 1999</span></figure>
      <div>
        <span class="zab-eye">A letter from Teta Huda</span>
        <div class="zab-paper" id="zab-paper">
          <p class="zab-line">Habibi,</p>
          <p class="zab-line">Your Jiddo used to say that olive oil remembers the hands that made it. If the hands were tired, the oil is bitter. If they were careful, it is sweet.</p>
          <p class="zab-line">So we were careful. We picked together, we ate together, and when a neighbour brought us olives, we weighed them in front of him and paid him the same day.</p>
          <p class="zab-line">The press is bigger now and the family is too, but that rule has not changed. Whoever brings us something good is treated like family.</p>
          <p class="zab-line">Come in, sit down. There is always bread and oil on this table.</p>
          <div class="zab-sign" id="zab-sign"><svg viewBox="0 0 220 80" aria-hidden="true"><path pathLength="1" d="M14 50 C24 22 38 20 36 42 C34 60 48 56 54 40 C60 26 66 52 76 46 C88 40 86 22 96 30 C104 36 94 58 110 54 C124 50 126 30 138 36 C150 42 140 60 156 56 C170 52 176 38 192 44 M30 66 C80 60 150 64 206 58"/></svg><small>Teta Huda<br>with love, Irbid</small></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. Family album -->
  <section class="zab-album" id="zab-album" aria-label="The family album">
    <div class="zab-wrap">
      <div class="zab-album-head"><span class="zab-eye">The family album</span><h2 class="zab-h2">Pages we<br><em>never throw away.</em></h2></div>
      <div class="zab-pages">
        <figure class="zab-pic" style="--r:-7deg;--x:-120px;--y:30px"><img src="/landing/images/olive-grove.jpg" alt="The family grove on the hills"><figcaption>Our grove, Ajloun hills</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="zab-pic" style="--r:5deg;--x:-40px;--y:-20px"><img src="/landing/images/stage-press.jpg" alt="Oil flowing from the press"><figcaption>The first green oil, 2019</figcaption></figure>
        <figure class="zab-pic" style="--r:-3deg;--x:40px;--y:40px"><img src="/landing/images/stage-bottle.jpg" alt="Bottles of olive oil on a table"><figcaption>Teta chose the green</figcaption></figure>
